  "translation_table_note": "SHLP1-4 match their published sequences only under Table 1 (cytosolic code: internal AGA/AGG or ATA codons), so the family is read under Table 1. SHLP5 and SHLP6 give the same human peptide under Tables 1 and 2 and are read under Table 1 as well; Cobb et al. 2016 do not state a genetic code. Under Table 2 an AGG at SHLP6 codon 14 would interrupt the frame in most non-hominid primates, against its reported conservation (Gruschus et al. 2023, Sci Rep 13:14110).",
